   "title": "Design & hull",
   "intro": "The Flush Deck range evolves with the new Solaris 74.\nThe 50 years’ experience of the Solaris shipyard has enabled the design and creation of an ambitious and extraordinary project: the new Solaris 74 goes beyond our imagination.\nThe Solaris Yacht 74 has been conceived by studying new spaces and needs, resulting in a unique product on the market.",
   "items": [],
   "images": []
  },
  {
   "kind": "block",
   "id": null,
   "title": "Interiors",
   "intro": "A spacious and luxurious saloon lies at the heart of the yacht, complemented by a separate, comfortable, and functional galley, large enough to offer both comfort and practicality. The engine room is located beneath the saloon, ensuring that the owner’s cabin, as well as the forward and aft guest cabins are free from noise and machinery.\nThe cockpit is designed with a central companionway and two tables, to enjoy relaxing moments as well.\nFinally, the owner will be able to choose and innovate the layout and finishings according to their personal preferences, enriching the design of this newly born Solaris 74, which is destined to sail oceans and seas all around the world.",
   "items": [],
   "images": []
  }
 ],
